    <h2>REC 101: Green Energy Unveiled</h2>
    <P style="width: 80%; margin-left:auto; margin-right: auto;">Explore the basics of Renewable Energy Certificates (RECs) in this informative series, guiding viewers through the concepts, impact, and how to engage in buying and selling to make a positive environmental difference. Join us in empowering a greener world!</P>

